/**
\mainpage Oxford Danfysik Bimorph Power Supply (ODPsu) EPICS Support Module
\section intro_sec Introduction 
This module supports FMB (formerly Oxford Danfysik) bimorph power supplies. 
Manufacturer's web site: <a href="http://www.fmb-oxford.com/">FMB Oxford</a>
\n
\section firmware_versions_sec Firmware versions

There are at least two versions of firmware in use at DLS.

MX Beamlines use firmware version "RXM2PN/24/490 - Version 0.13b  06.06.2006"

I24 uses "RXM2PN/24/490 - Version 1.2 29.08"

\section manufacturer_documentation_sec Manufacturer-provided documentation

Some manufacturer documentation is available in \$(TOP)/etc/private/manufacturer

Getting-Started-Guide-2.0.pdf \n
S1400-Bimorph-Power-Supply-DLS-I18-USER-MANUAL-2.0a.pdf \n
47544-21-appendix-A-revision-K.pdf \n

\section build_sec Build Instructions 
\subsection templatesV1_sec Templates for older firmware
For the older firmware:
Protocol file  ODPsu.protocol

Templates: \n
   ODPsu.template once per power supply \n
   ODPsuBank.template once per bank (normally two banks) \n
   ODPsuChannel.template once per channel (e.g. 16, 22, 24) \n
   
   ODPsu16DUpdate.vdb once per power supply (in case of 16 channels) \n
   ODPsu22DUpdate.vdb once per power supply (in case of 22 channels) \n
   ODPsu24DUpdate.vdb once per power supply (in case of 24 channels) \n
   
   ODPsuFormat16.template once per power supply (in case of 16 channels) \n
   ODPsuFormat22.template once per power supply (in case of 22 channels) \n
   
   ODPsugda.template \n


\subsection templatesV2_sec Templates for newer firmware
For the newer firmware:
Protocol file  ODPsuV2.protocol \n
Templates:\n
ODPsuV2.template \n
ODPsuBankV2.vdb \n
ODPsuChannelV2.template \n
ODPsugdaV2.template \n

\section simulation_sec Simulation

There is a simulation for the older firmware version in \$(TOP)/etc/simulations/ODPsu_sim.py


**/

